<item><title>Bank of Uganda keeps key rate at 12 per cent as inflation rises</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/bank-of-uganda-keeps-key-rate-at-12-per-cent-as-inflation-7b0a1f/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/bank-of-uganda-keeps-key-rate-at-12-per-cent-as-inflation-7b0a1f/</guid><category>Uganda</category><description>The central bank held its benchmark rate after an October increase, warning that a weaker shilling and fuel costs could push prices higher still.</description><pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 05:11:51 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/bank-of-uganda-keeps-key-rate-at-12-per-cent-as-inflation-7b0a1f/share.jpg" length="43450" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/bank-of-uganda-keeps-key-rate-at-12-per-cent-as-inflation-7b0a1f/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
